    {
      "id": 246198,
      "name": "",
      "username": "Omegatron",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/omegatron/{size}/4904_2.png",
      "created_at": "2022-07-10T15:56:51.723Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It’s just shorthand, I wouldn’t expect them to write out:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>9+ Minions and Lieutenants loyal to the Overlord in the scene<br>\n5-8 Minions and Lieutenants loyal to the Overlord in the scene<br>\n3-4 Minions and Lieutenants loyal to the Overlord in the scene<br>\netc.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>The point of lieutenants is to be more resilient than minions so it wouldn’t make much sense to let a player with the right ability destroy them in one shot, but I don’t think it would make much difference if you ran it the other way.</p>",
      "post_number": 5,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2022-07-10T15:57:40.668Z",
